<title>SWEDEN: Orrefors board recommends 'yes' to bid.</title>
<headline>Orrefors board recommends 'yes' to bid.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish luxury glass maker Orrefors Kosta Boda AB said on Wednesday its board recommended shareholders accept a takeover bid for 155 crowns per share.</p>
<p>&quot;The entire board decided to recommend to shareholders in Orrefors Kosta Boda AB to accept the offer to sell their shares in the company at a price of 155 crowns per share to the consortium made up of Proventus AB, Royal Copenhagen A/S and Scandinavian Equity Partners,&quot; the company said in a statement.</p>
</text>
